# No local .env is required for this project — authentication is handled by
# `npx tgcloud login`, which stores the CLI access token in .tgcloud/credentials.
#
# If you want to drive deploys from CI instead, set the following environment
# variable in your CI secret store (do NOT commit it):
#
#   TGCLOUD_TOKEN=<your-cli-access-token-from-BotFather>
#
# This token is the CLI access token from @BotFather → your bot → Serverless →
# CLI Access — it is separate from the bot's HTTP API token.
